        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Michigan Consolidated Gas Company and Gas Workers Local No. 80 united to formally describe to the various classifications of work in which the employees of the Company are engaged, to establish a base rate for each group and to place and maintain the employees in their proper classifications.",
            "block_bbox": [
                46,
                174,
                627,
                262
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    46.0,
                    174.0
                ],
                [
                    627.0,
                    174.0
                ],
                [
                    627.0,
                    262.0
                ],
                [
                    46.0,
                    262.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The following basic conditions of classification control shall be recognized as applying throughout the classifications:",
            "block_bbox": [
                46,
                280,
                626,
                326
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    46.0,
                    280.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    280.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    326.0
                ],
                [
                    46.0,
                    326.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1) Physical Conditions – Employees may be transferred to other work involving a reclassification if they are physically qualified, or they become physically unable to perform their present duties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                48,
                345,
                626,
                413
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    48.0,
                    345.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    345.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    413.0
                ],
                [
                    48.0,
                    413.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2) Change in Classification – A change in the employee's classification which requires a change in duties will be made only when there is a need and when the employee has given evidence of qualifying for the work.",
            "block_bbox": [
                46,
                433,
                626,
                500
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    46.0,
                    433.0
                ],
                [
                    625.0,
                    433.0
                ],
                [
                    625.0,
                    495.0
                ],
                [
                    46.0,
                    495.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3) Listed Duties – It is not practical to list in detail all of the duties normally assigned to each group, but those listed are typical, showing the general types of jobs, and it shall be understood that any allied duties are included.",
            "block_bbox": [
                46,
                520,
                626,
                588
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    46.0,
                    520.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    520.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    46.0,
                    588.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4) Assignment of Duties – When the need arises, employees may be used on other types of work than that used which they are classified without affecting their classifications, unless, or until the change becomes permanent.",
            "block_bbox": [
                45,
                607,
                624,
                675
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    45.0,
                    607.0
                ],
                [
                    624.0,
                    607.0
                ],
                [
                    624.0,
                    675.0
                ],
                [
                    45.0,
                    675.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5) Transfers – When an employee is transferred temporarily from one department to another, no change in classification will be made. When permanent transfers are made, the reclassification will be made at the time of the transfer.",
            "block_bbox": [
                45,
                694,
                624,
                761
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    45.0,
                    694.0
                ],
                [
                    624.0,
                    694.0
                ],
                [
                    624.0,
                    761.0
                ],
                [
                    45.0,
                    761.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6) Date of Change – Except as specifically provided in this Foreword with respect to Probationers and New Employees, classification changes will become effective on the beginning of the pay period following the completion of the qualifying period. When the employee is officially placed on advanced assignment to a higher classification, he or she will receive the rate of pay of the higher classification.",
